                                "sense_id": "6f089101-0992-3569-8762-90c65bb12334",
                                "text": "She's so neighbourly that she always holds a welcoming party for new residents."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6cc507b0-c517-4826-b4f5-90eeb5a1ca87",
                                "sense_id": "6f089101-0992-3569-8762-90c65bb12334",
                                "text": "I got the impression you were looking for something, and it crossed my mind to ask you what that might be. Just being friendly, sir, just being neighbourly."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
